1269 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 178 0 R
/E (Have you ever noticed how glued are we to screens? From phones and laptops to tablets and TVs, teenagers now spend much of their day online.)
/Pg 27 0 R
/K [31]
>>
endobj
1270 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 178 0 R
/E (On average, many of us spend four to six hours a day on screens. The good news is that screens offer amazing opportunities. We can learn new things, keep in touch with friends and be entertained. In fact, online lessons and videos can make studying more interesting sad flexible.)
/Pg 27 0 R
/K [32]
>>
endobj
1271 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 178 0 R
/E (However, there's is down inside. There's much screen time can lead to tired eyes, poor sleep and less exercise. What's more, it can affect our mood and make us feel amazes or bored. We'll prepare ourselves to others online.)
/Pg 27 0 R
/K [33]
>>
