/P 178 0 R
/E (Most teenagers spend around five hours a day on screens. While this can help with schoolwork and staying connected, it can also cause problems. Sitting for long periods may lead to headaches, poor posture and less exercise. Do we really want to risk our health for endless scrolling?)
/Pg 27 0 R
/K [47]
>>
